%% title: Nightly drift check
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as estate-kit service, nightly
    participant G as GitHub
    participant O as ghcr
    participant DB as service cache
    S->>G: latest release of each admitted repository
    S->>O: latest fragment and prod tag
    S->>DB: cached copies
    S->>S: compare all three
    opt they differ
        S->>G: report the drift as an issue or a check
    end
